{
  "pack_id": "gpai-eu-v1",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "source": "EU AI Act Reg. (EU) 2024/1689 Annex XI & Annex XII, and the GPAI Code of Practice Model Documentation Form. Item presence only; cites regulatory source per item. NOT a compliance certification (SPEC.md §1, §10).",
